  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1737561746_2983884_58cf10039617319e51130c6d1a842fbd.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight); color: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); line-height: calc(1 + .3/max(1,var(--font-heading-scale))); word-break: break-word; font-size: calc(var(--font-heading-scale) * 2.4rem); max-width: 100%; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"banner__heading inline-richtext h2\">The pre and post activity shoe for bike-packers, hikers and other free spirits.</h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: var(--font-heading-family); font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight); color: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); line-height: calc(1 + .3/max(1,var(--font-heading-scale))); word-break: break-word; font-size: calc(var(--font-heading-scale) * 2.4rem); max-width: 100%; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; text-align: center; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" class=\"banner__heading inline-richtext h2\">&bull; Product description:&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">BERT is a new kind of &lsquo;pre and post-activity shoe&rsquo; worn by hikers, bike-packers and other free spirits, before and after their time on the trail.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Active people like bike-packers and hikers&nbsp; are always looking for ways to save space and weight.&nbsp; When they pack for the adventure ahead, every inch and gram counts. Packing smart is key. That's why Bert shoes are made to squeeze into the tightest places, freeing up much-needed space and keeping you light on your feet wherever you go.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): No one has given you a shoe that takes you to your favorite sport and brings you back home.<br>&bull; Payment terms: Paypal/Bank Transfer<br>&bull; Other information: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://thebertshoe.com/pages/sustainability\" rel=\"noopener\">https://thebertshoe.com/pages/sustainability</a></p>\r\n</div>",
